                                Nasal discharge, coughing, swollen face
                            </small>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start mb-3">
                            <span class="badge badge-fowlpox me-2 mt-1">
                                Fowl Pox
                            </span>
                            <small class="text-muted">
                                Wart-like lesions on comb and face
                            </small>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
                            <span class="badge badge-healthy me-2 mt-1">
                                Healthy
                            </span>
                            <small class="text-muted">
                                No visible disease symptoms
